@SolaraeStudio
I like the cleaner look. However, there is a change of focal points between the two. On the left, my eyes focus on the environment, and this is preferred, however on the right, my eyes focus on the characters. I'm not sure how that's helpful to you.
As for the topic at hand, I can only speak from experience with other engines that it's all the same things I've seen before.
